# NAME: APTV Domain
# PURPOSE: Route overseas APTV / PPV portal and EPG domains via a single-hop proxy instead of chained relay.
# ORDER: Place in the NON-IP section (before GEOIP,CN,DIRECT) to avoid slow local DNS lookups.
# NOTE: Assign a single-hop proxy policy (e.g. Bandwagon-Snell or 链式代理前置); chained relay is unnecessary.

# PPV / IPTV portals and CNAME targets
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,3691065.site
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ppvservices.st
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,dndnscloud.ru
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,linednline.ru

# APTV official EPG
DOMAIN,epg.aptv.app
